{"3851600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pulsebreaker", "steam_appid": 3851600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4739030], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Overview</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pulsebreaker</i> is a classic survival horror game inspired by classics from the <i>Playstation 1</i> Era. It blends tense exploration and puzzle solving with light action mechanics, forcing you to carefully manage resources, choose what to carry, and decide which paths to take. When cornered utilize the <strong>Focus Meter</strong> to make every shot count and conserve your precious ammo while beating back the undead or worse. Every decision matters and a single mistake could mean a grisly end at the hands of zombies and other freakish creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851600/extras/ca4fc5aec4950e80fcc0b80bd9d2537d.avif?t=1783343364\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851600/extras_big/ca4fc5aec4950e80fcc0b80bd9d2537d.webp?t=1783343364 width=1560 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851600/extras/6951996a66746be99f7a83c4ee2b131d.poster.avif?t=1783343364\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851600/extras/6951996a66746be99f7a83c4ee2b131d.webm?t=1783343364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851600/extras/6951996a66746be99f7a83c4ee2b131d.mp4?t=1783343364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate tight corridors</strong>, <strong>evade the undead</strong>, and use your <strong>limited ammo and items </strong>wisely if you hope to survive the horrors ahead. Collect ammo, medicine, and other useful items to help you survive a city crawling with the undead and worse. Think strategically as you manage your dwindling supplies, knowing when to fight and when to flee is critical. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851600/extras/d265ea45554df4c4f04d9d3db9953c00.avif?t=1783343364\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851600/extras_big/d265ea45554df4c4f04d9d3db9953c00.webp?t=1783343364 width=1560 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851600/extras/3ea0e34564b6360734b3acd9481346da.poster.avif?t=1783343364\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851600/extras/3ea0e34564b6360734b3acd9481346da.webm?t=1783343364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851600/extras/3ea0e34564b6360734b3acd9481346da.mp4?t=1783343364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain <strong>multi-stagger combos</strong>, land <strong>critical headshots</strong>, and deliver well-timed <strong>melee kicks</strong> to keep enemies at bay with the <strong>Focus Meter.</strong> Survival still demands skill, timing, and control. Master your tools, or be overwhelmed by the numerous zombies seeking to feast on your flesh. But don’t get comfortable. The Focus Meter doesn’t make you overpowered; <i>it simply levels the playing field</i> <i>and only when mastering it can you hope to truly excel.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851600/extras/0f3f913b4e5c502b40dc5d146f671a11.avif?t=1783343364\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851600/extras_big/0f3f913b4e5c502b40dc5d146f671a11.webp?t=1783343364 width=1560 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851600/extras/9fc55dc2bd5d338eb46867a924941db3.poster.avif?t=1783343364\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851600/extras/9fc55dc2bd5d338eb46867a924941db3.webm?t=1783343364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851600/extras/9fc55dc2bd5d338eb46867a924941db3.mp4?t=1783343364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Danger lurks around every corner. Presented in a beautifully crafted <strong>PS1-inspired</strong> visual style with <strong>fixed camera angles</strong>, <i>Pulsebreaker</i> drops you into claustrophobic environments filled with relentless threats. Discover the lore of a world run amok with the living dead.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Overview</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pulsebreaker</i> is a classic survival horror game inspired by classics from the <i>Playstation 1</i> Era. It blends tense exploration and puzzle solving with light action mechanics, forcing you to carefully manage resources, choose what to carry, and decide which paths to take. When cornered utilize the <strong>Focus Meter</strong> to make every shot count and conserve your precious ammo while beating back the undead or worse. Every decision matters and a single mistake could mean a grisly end at the hands of zombies and other freakish creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851600/extras/ca4fc5aec4950e80fcc0b80bd9d2537d.avif?t=1783343364\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851600/extras_big/ca4fc5aec4950e80fcc0b80bd9d2537d.webp?t=1783343364 width=1560 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851600/extras/6951996a66746be99f7a83c4ee2b131d.poster.avif?t=1783343364\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851600/extras/6951996a66746be99f7a83c4ee2b131d.webm?t=1783343364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851600/extras/6951996a66746be99f7a83c4ee2b131d.mp4?t=1783343364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate tight corridors</strong>, <strong>evade the undead</strong>, and use your <strong>limited ammo and items </strong>wisely if you hope to survive the horrors ahead. Collect ammo, medicine, and other useful items to help you survive a city crawling with the undead and worse. Think strategically as you manage your dwindling supplies, knowing when to fight and when to flee is critical. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851600/extras/d265ea45554df4c4f04d9d3db9953c00.avif?t=1783343364\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851600/extras_big/d265ea45554df4c4f04d9d3db9953c00.webp?t=1783343364 width=1560 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851600/extras/3ea0e34564b6360734b3acd9481346da.poster.avif?t=1783343364\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851600/extras/3ea0e34564b6360734b3acd9481346da.webm?t=1783343364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851600/extras/3ea0e34564b6360734b3acd9481346da.mp4?t=1783343364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain <strong>multi-stagger combos</strong>, land <strong>critical headshots</strong>, and deliver well-timed <strong>melee kicks</strong> to keep enemies at bay with the <strong>Focus Meter.</strong> Survival still demands skill, timing, and control. Master your tools, or be overwhelmed by the numerous zombies seeking to feast on your flesh. But don’t get comfortable. The Focus Meter doesn’t make you overpowered; <i>it simply levels the playing field</i> <i>and only when mastering it can you hope to truly excel.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851600/extras/0f3f913b4e5c502b40dc5d146f671a11.avif?t=1783343364\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851600/extras_big/0f3f913b4e5c502b40dc5d146f671a11.webp?t=1783343364 width=1560 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851600/extras/9fc55dc2bd5d338eb46867a924941db3.poster.avif?t=1783343364\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"http